<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42884" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσθ-έω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσθής</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>clothe :</i> only
			pf. and plpf.
			
				Pass.
			, mostly in part.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠσθημένος,</span>
			
				Ion.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσθημένος,</span>
			<i>clothed</i> or <i>clad,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i>in</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσθῆτα ἐσθημένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.112
				</span></i>
			 : c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥάκεσι ἐσθημένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.129
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠσθημένοι πέπλοισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					1539
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πελοποννησιακῶς ἠσθημένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pythaen.
					6
				</span></i>
			 : 3pl.
			pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤσθηνται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					121
				</span></i>
			 : 3sg.
			plpf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤσθητο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>VH</u>
					12.32
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠσθῆσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>NA</u>
					16.34
				</span></i>
			.</div>
